{"id": "hriday-010", "text": "Route my 2023 Rivian R1S Large Pack from Jackson, Wyoming to West Yellowstone. Charge is 30%, arrival target is 18%, and I only want CCS charging.", "category": "sparse_charging", "gold_request": {"origin": "Jackson, WY", "destination": "West Yellowstone, MT", "vehicle_id": "rivian-r1s-dual-large-2023", "start_soc_pct": 30, "arrival_soc_pct_min": 18, "connectors_override": ["CCS1"]}, "clarification_required": false, "missing_safety_fields": [], "hard_constraints": {"arrival_soc_pct_min": 18, "connectors_override": ["CCS1"]}, "soft_constraints": {}, "notes": "Text says only 'Large Pack' without the motor config; the CSV's only R1S row is the Dual-Motor Large Pack, so I mapped to it. 30% won't reach the destination with 18% left, so a CCS-only stop is needed in a sparse area; if no CCS charger exists on the route, this could be 'infeasible'."}
{"id": "hriday-012", "text": "My 2024 F-150 Lightning Extended Range is at 32%. Plan Farmington, New Mexico to Page, Arizona, use chargers of at least 100 kW, and leave me 20% at the end.", "category": "sparse_charging", "gold_request": {"origin": "Farmington, NM", "destination": "Page, AZ", "vehicle_id": "ford-f-150-lightning-er-2024", "start_soc_pct": 32, "arrival_soc_pct_min": 20, "min_power_kw": 100}, "clarification_required": false, "missing_safety_fields": [], "hard_constraints": {"arrival_soc_pct_min": 20, "min_power_kw": 100}, "soft_constraints": {}, "notes": "Route crosses the Four Corners / Navajo Nation region where fast chargers are sparse; 32% is not enough to arrive with 20% without a stop."}
{"id": "hriday-022", "text": "My 2024 Tesla Model 3 Long Range AWD is at half a battery. I need to go from Mesa to Glendale, Arizona.", "category": "incomplete", "gold_request": {"origin": "Mesa, AZ", "destination": "Glendale, AZ", "vehicle_id": "tesla-model-3-lr-awd-2024"}, "clarification_required": true, "missing_safety_fields": ["start_soc_pct"], "hard_constraints": {}, "soft_constraints": {}, "notes": "'Half a battery' is not an exact number (half-a-tank rule), so start_soc_pct is left out and flagged. 'Arizona' read as covering both cities. If the guide accepts 'half' as 50, this becomes 'urban' with start_soc_pct 50 and no clarification."}
{"id": "hriday-030", "text": "No rush today. Plan my 2024 Kia EV9 Long Range RWD from Salt Lake City to Moab with 30% charge; I'd rather have a comfortable meal stop even if charging takes longer.", "category": "priority_tradeoff", "gold_request": {"origin": "Salt Lake City, UT", "destination": "Moab, UT", "vehicle_id": "kia-ev9-lr-rwd-2024", "start_soc_pct": 30, "amenities": [{"category": "food"}], "tradeoff_profile": "comfort"}, "clarification_required": false, "missing_safety_fields": [], "hard_constraints": {}, "soft_constraints": {"amenities": ["food"]}, "notes": "Driver explicitly ranks comfort over charging time ('no rush', 'even if charging takes longer') -> tradeoff_profile comfort. 'I'd rather' is a wish, not need/must, so no priority."}
